    ## pumpkin-util/src/biome.rs.
    None, Frozen

  Weather* = object
    ## pumpkin-util/src/biome.rs: the data only. `compute_temperature` waits on that file's port.
    hasPrecipitation*: bool
    temperature*: float32
    temperatureModifier*: TemperatureModifier
    downfall*: float32

  Spawner* = object
    `type`*: string
